OL,5,G2350 Mary Cassatt: Painting The Modern
OL,6,G     Woman
OL,7,     FRevisit the career of Mary Cassatt
OL,8,     Fthrough prints, pastels and
OL,9,     Fpaintings, exploring the
OL,10,     Foften-overlooked Impressionist's
OL,11,     Finfluence on how women appear in
OL,12,     Fart.
OL,13,G0100 Klimt & The Kiss
OL,14,     FExperts examine 'The Kiss' -
OL,15,     FGustav Klimt's iconic painting
OL,16,     Ffrom the early 20th century - and
OL,17,     Festablish just what makes it such
OL,18,     Fan enduring, endearing piece.
